    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds A Default Address" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Default Address</p>
            <p>Creates a new default address with country and address type selections</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Address: "Nairobi", Postal Code: 90402, Locality/Province/District literal values</p>
            <step>Navigate to Settings → Default Addresses</step>
            <step>Click Add to open the add form</step>
            <step>Fill address fields (address, postal code, locality, province, district)</step>
            <step>Select Country and Address Type via first and second drop-down boxes</step>
            <step>Click Save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast: "Default address has been added."</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
